{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come and experience the frenetic chaos of Ominigun</strong>, a pixel art bullet hell where you shouldn't be fooled by cute animals \u2014 they\u2019re out to blow your head off.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to shoot, run, and survive this angelic yet ruthless world, with a special and unique twist. Out of bullets? No problem \u2014 even your weapons are thrown when depleted. Now run, explore, and collect as many weapons as you can. Don\u2019t stop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your custom deck of buffs to adapt your strategies and help Ominigun prepare for new waves of furious cuteness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful at the end of each room \u2014 unique bosses await, with absolutely no intention of letting Ominigun move forward alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every area for more weapons and keep your inventory packed \u2014 you\u2019re going to need it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the rooms and the dynamic chaos of each run. The game offers a challenging and fun experience every time, with small elements of randomness that keep things fresh.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Just the Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Silence","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Future","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the Past","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat Faith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"},{"name":"Exterminate!!!!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"},{"name":"I Can Destroy the World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Fight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3817830/f53b92b275266d592ef7ac7fa76b9296e4e9fdf9.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3817830?t=1754198201","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817830/0694a5f50af40679fba2c3c72c0fc85a6d2bac28/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754198201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817830/3b4737a2ed79d52f1de66fe8f657dfbad4c916b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754198201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817830/3b4737a2ed79d52f1de66fe8f657dfbad4c916b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754198201","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Come and experience the frenetic chaos of Ominigun</strong>, a pixel art bullet hell where you shouldn't be fooled by cute animals \u2014 they\u2019re out to blow your head off.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Objective</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to shoot, run, and survive this angelic yet ruthless world, with a special and unique twist. Out of bullets? No problem \u2014 even your weapons are thrown when depleted. Now run, explore, and collect as many weapons as you can. Don\u2019t stop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your custom deck of buffs to adapt your strategies and help Ominigun prepare for new waves of furious cuteness.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful at the end of each room \u2014 unique bosses await, with absolutely no intention of letting Ominigun move forward alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search every area for more weapons and keep your inventory packed \u2014 you\u2019re going to need it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chaos!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to the rooms and the dynamic chaos of each run. The game offers a challenging and fun experience every time, with small elements of randomness that keep things fresh.</p>","developers":["Joas Neves"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817830/0e284cb4dc273a0c153cdaef553b689acdae07b3/header.jpg?t=1754198201","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3817830/165856030/e1f96326e07aa4f075c09d7a5c3fd9ec8843169b/1754196704/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754198196","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3817830/165856030/e1f96326e07aa4f075c09d7a5c3fd9ec8843169b/1754196704/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754198196","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3817830/165856030/e1f96326e07aa4f075c09d7a5c3fd9ec8843169b/1754196704/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754198196","id":257177455,"name":"Ominigun","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177455/537dd3122d17da15a337681c2bf4ddddf6b9a036/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754198196"}],"name":"Ominigun","package_groups"